  answer: Symphony Of The Air
  acceptedAnswers:
  - Symphony Of The Air
  hints:
  - "Su cat\xE1logo registrado incluye \xABSerenade After Plato's Symposium: V. Socrates
    - Alcibiades\xBB, de 1947, y llega hasta 1958."
  - "\xABSerenade for Solo Violin, Strings, Harp and Percussion after Plato's \"Symposium\"
    (1954): I. Phaedrus: Pausanias (Lento - Allegro)\xBB presenta una energ\xEDa
    suave y un pulso cercano a 99 BPM."
  - "Entre sus grabaciones figuran \xABSerenade for Solo Violin, Strings, Harp and
    Percussion after Plato's \"Symposium\" (1954): IV. Agathon (Adagio)\xBB y \xABSerenade
    for Solo Violin, Strings, Harp and Percussion after Plato's \"Symposium\" (1954):
    III. Eryximachus (Presto)\xBB."
  - "Tambi\xE9n lanz\xF3 \xABPiano Concerto No. 2 in F Minor, Op. 21: Maestoso\xBB."
  - "Es el proyecto musical detr\xE1s de \xABPiano Concerto No. 5 in E-Flat Major,
    Op. 73 \"Emperor\": II. Adagio un poco mosso\xBB y \xABPiano Concerto No. 2 in
    F Minor, Op. 21: III. Allegro vivace\xBB."
